                "description": "Emtek's Round Knob with Neos Rose has a mid-century modern style that is only accentuated through the use of bold and beautiful finishes. Choose from a wide array of colors, including satin brass and polished nickel. The Modern Brass Round Knobset with Neos Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions.",
